        "content": "<p>I suggest reviewing <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4-nightly-testing/compare/bump/v4.33.0...leanprover-community:mathlib4-nightly-testing:reviewable-nightly-2026-07-07?expand=1\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4-nightly-testing/compare/bump/v4.33.0...leanprover-community:mathlib4-nightly-testing:reviewable-nightly-2026-07-07?expand=1</a></p>\n<p>Those 7 commits contain a rewritten history of this PR.<br>\nThe following script shows that the first 3~4 commits are completely mechanical. The final commits should be reviewed manually.<br>\nIt also verifies that the rewritten history produces a git tree that is byte-identical to this PR.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"ch\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># Verify the reviewable reconstruction of the nightly-2026-07-07 lean4#13895 adaptation.</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-euo<span class=\"w\"> </span>pipefail\n\n<span class=\"nv\">BRANCH</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">'reviewable-nightly-2026-07-07'</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">BASE</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">'origin/bump/v4.33.0'</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">PR_HEAD</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">'origin/bump/nightly-2026-07-07'</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\"># nightly#263 head branch</span>\n\ngit<span class=\"w\"> </span>rev-parse<span class=\"w\"> </span>--verify<span class=\"w\"> </span>-q<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>&gt;/dev/null<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"branch </span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\"> not found\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">exit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">N</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"k\">$(</span>git<span class=\"w\"> </span>rev-list<span class=\"w\"> </span>--count<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BASE</span><span class=\"s2\">..</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"k\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"This branch has </span><span class=\"nv\">$N</span><span class=\"s2\"> commits on top of \\`bump/v4.33.0\\`.\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Every added/removed line of commit $1 must equal exactly $2.</span>\ncheck<span class=\"o\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">sha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nv\">$1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">want</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nv\">$2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Verifying commit adds only lines of the form \\\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$want</span><span class=\"s2\">\\\": \"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>bad<span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">bad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"k\">$(</span>git<span class=\"w\"> </span>diff<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$sha</span><span class=\"s2\">^\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$sha</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-E<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^[+-]'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-vE<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^(\\+\\+\\+|---)'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                   </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>sed<span class=\"w\"> </span>-E<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'s/^[+-]//'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-vE<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^[[:space:]]*$'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-vxF<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$want</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">true</span><span class=\"k\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-z<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$bad</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✓\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✗\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">printf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'%s\\n'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$bad</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>sed<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'s/^/    unexpected: /'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">exit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\ncheck<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">~6\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false in'</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\"># commit 1</span>\ncheck<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">~5\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false in'</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"c1\"># commit 2</span>\ncheck<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">~4\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'@[implicit_reducible]'</span><span class=\"w\">                                            </span><span class=\"c1\"># commit 3</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Commit 4: mechanical tail — every changed line is a set_option/attribute, but not one string.</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Verifying commit 4 only contains mechanical set_option/attribute lines: \"</span>\ngit<span class=\"w\"> </span>diff<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">~3^\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">~3\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-E<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^[+-]'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-vE<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^(\\+\\+\\+|---)'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>sed<span class=\"w\"> </span>-E<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'s/^[+-][[:space:]]*//'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-vE<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'^$'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>grep<span class=\"w\"> </span>-qvE<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'implicit_reducible|instance_reducible|backward\\.isDefEq\\.respectTransparency|backward\\.defeqAttrib|allowUnsafeReducibility|\"backward\\.isDefEq\\.respectTransparency'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✗\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">exit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✓\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Commits 5, 6, 7 (adaptation notes / proof fixes / new test files) need manual review.\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Verifying \\`</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">\\` is byte-identical to PR branch nightly#263: \"</span>\ngit<span class=\"w\"> </span>diff<span class=\"w\"> </span>--quiet<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$PR_HEAD</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"nv\">$BRANCH</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✓\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">echo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"✗\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">exit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
